       fhir:ElementDefinition.comment [ fhir:value "Can express \"as needed\" without a reason by setting the Boolean = True.  In this case the CodeableConcept is not populated.  Or you can express \"as needed\" with a reason by including the CodeableConcept.  In this case the Boolean is assumed to be True.  If you set the Boolean to False, then the dose is given according to the schedule and is not \"prn\" or \"as needed\"." ] ;
